  "content": "中标追踪\n公告信息\n项目名称\t东莞农村商业银行科技大楼智慧中心项目一期机房工程（第二次招标）\n交易机构名称\t东莞市公共资源交易中心\n公告性质\t更正公告\n项目编号\tE4419000748010723001\n统一交易标识码\tZ99-124419003519028823-20251106-096434-7\n公告内容<p style=\"margin-left:1px;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:150%\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">问题编号：</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">WTBH760853</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-left:1px;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">一、商务答疑</span></p><p style=\"margin-right:4px;margin-left:1px;text-indent:29px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">1.根据东莞农村商业银行科技大楼智慧中心项目一期机房工程（第二次招标）补充通知（二）修</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">改可知，质量员、施工员、材料员、资料员需同时提供住房城</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">乡建设行业从业人员培训管理信息系统</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">查询截图。</span></p><p style=\"margin-right:4px;margin-left:1px;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">依据建办人函〔</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">2019〕384</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -3px;font-size: 14px\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px\">号规定：培训合格证</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">作为施工现场专业人员具备相应专业知识水平的证明，在全国住房和城乡建设领域予以认可。</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:1px;text-indent:29px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">山东省住房和城乡建设厅颁发的住房城乡建设领域施工现场专业人员、技能人员培训</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">/等级证书，与 “住房城乡建设行业从业人员培训管理信息系统”（住建部国网，</span></span><a href=\"file:///C:/Users/27539/Desktop/rcgz.mohurd.gov.cn\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:-0;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">rcgz.mohurd.gov.c</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:-0;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">n</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">）颁发的同</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">类型电子培训合格证书、技能等级证书，用于建筑业企业资质</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">申报、工程招投标、施工备案、现场实</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px\">名制核查及住建领域日常监管时，具有完全相同的法律效力，全国住建领域互认、各省市通</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">用。</span></p><p style=\"margin-right:4px;margin-left:1px;text-indent:28px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:150%\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">请问：我单位只具有山东省住房和城乡建设厅颁发的质量员、施工员、材料员、资料员证书，并且可在《山东省建设从业人员管理系统》</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(5, 99, 193);letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">htt</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(5, 99, 193);letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">ps://119.148.161.89:8001/const/certInquiry</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">查询（后</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">附查询截图</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -3px;font-size: 14px\">），</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">请明确提供山东省建委颁发的证书和网站查询截图</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\">是否予以认可？此项为资格条款，如果不被认可我单位将没有投标资格。</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-indent:24px;text-autospace:none;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">答复：详见</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">“东莞农村商业银行科技大楼智慧中心项目一期机房工程（第二次招标）补充通知（三）”要求。</span></span></p><p><br/></p>"
}